{
  "description": "将当前表格转换为可编辑专业图表，保留对象身份、位置、样式和其它对象。用已观察的 target 或 path，to=chart；chartType 可选 bar/line/area/pie/donut。categoryColumn/valueColumns 按列从1计数，默认首列类别、其余列数值。软件读取当前表格及声明表头、产生图表身份并一次提交；不要求复制原表格数据或内部编号。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$defs": {
      "__schema0": {
        "const": "chart",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "__schema1": {
        "enum": [
          "bar",
          "line",
          "area",
          "pie",
          "donut"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "__schema2": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "__schema3": {
        "description": "Category column, counted from 1. Defaults to the first column.",
        "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
        "maximum": 9007199254740991,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "__schema4": {
        "description": "Numeric series columns, counted from 1. Defaults to all columns except the category column.",
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema5"
        },
        "minItems": 1,
        "type": "array"
      },
      "__schema5": {
        "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
        "maximum": 9007199254740991,
        "type": "integer"
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "anyOf": [
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "categoryColumn": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema3"
          },
          "chartType": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
          },
          "target": {
            "maxLength": 100,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2"
          },
          "to": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
          },
          "valueColumns": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema4"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "to",
          "target"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "categoryColumn": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema3"
          },
          "chartType": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
          },
          "path": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "project": {
            "maxLength": 1000,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2"
          },
          "to": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
          },
          "valueColumns": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema4"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "to",
          "path"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "转换对象类型",
    "targetKinds": [
      "course-instance"
    ]
  },
  "name": "object.convert",
  "version": 1
}
